# Browser
# What the page shows of a suspected creature (CR 701.60): the Skeleton Case of the Stashed Skeleton makes and suspects says
# SUSPECTED at its foot, and the menace and "This creature can't block" the designation gives it (CR 701.60c) are written
# among its rules; the Case, unsolved while the Skeleton is there, says nothing at its foot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Case of the Stashed Skeleton
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Status = SUSPECTED
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Rules = Menace / This creature can't block.
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Status =

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Suspected = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Solved = (absent)
